# Conformance probe pack for the field option `with` (spec 0.18) on the `json`
# wire. Public. No kinds. Each line below states what it pins:
#
#   y   with x       a scalar holds when present, 0 included (ruling 2)
#   z   with s1      the empty text holds (ruling 2)
#   w   with items   a list holds when present with at least one item
#   c1  with c1      its own key, beside a default (ruling 3)
#   c2  with n       n has a default here; a default never holds (ruling 2)
#   s   two lines    s2 with y, then callsign: a suppressed first line is not
#                    a candidate, the later line is written (ruling 1)
#   q   with notx    probe.notx is derived (`not probe.x`): ruling 14
#   items            qty with label (an item key), val with x (a key the
#                    group maps, checked on the item only: ruling 2)
#   nums             a scalar item suppressed is null (ruling 4)
format  conformance-cond-json
version 0.18.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses    probe
wire    json
field   probe.x   x   int
field   probe.y   y   int  with probe.x
field   probe.z   z   int  with probe.s1
field   probe.w   w   int  with probe.items
field   probe.c1  c1  int  with probe.c1
default probe.c1  7
field   probe.n   n   int
default probe.n   3
field   probe.c2  c2  int  with probe.n
field   probe.s1  s1  string
field   probe.s2  s   string  with probe.y
field   callsign  s   string
field   probe.qty q   int  with probe.notx
group   probe.items  items
  field probe.label  label  string
  field probe.qty    qty    int  with probe.label
  field probe.val    val    int  with probe.x
end
group   probe.nums  nums
  field probe.val  .  int  with probe.tag
end
